1080 POKE V2+4,65:POKE V2+4,64:KT=TI+60:RETURN
1090 REM RING BELL (TRIANGLE, LONGER RELEASE)
1100 POKE V3,0:POKE V3+1,140:POKE V3+5,9:POKE V3+6,8:POKE V3+4,17:POKE V3+4,16
1110 KT=TI+60:RETURN
