1140 GOSUB 1060
1150 G%(XR,XC)=VAL(K$)
1160 R=XR:C=XC:GOSUB 940
1170 POKE AD,64+VAL(K$)-30*(NT%(XR,XC)<>0):SV=0
1180 POKE CD,10
1190 RETURN
