1990 R3=RX-INT(RX/3)*3
2000 IN=3*R3+INT(RX/3)+CX
2010 BS=IN-INT(IN/9)*9
2020 G%(R+1,C+1)=DP%(BS):F%(R+1,C+1)=1:SL%(R+1,C+1)=DP%(BS)
